{"id":"u-2bfb8c8a-9658-4d31-b3d3-34c3c0f11ae3","src":"community","title":"DUP BENCH PRIORITY","author":"Heinrich A.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/TpJ9vN-hein-dup","desc":"This 4-day program uses Daily Undulating Periodization (DUP) to target strength in Squat, Bench, and Deadlift while hitting weak points and accessory muscles 2× per week.\n\nHow to increase weight weekly:\n\nBase all lifts on a Training Max (TM):\n\nUse ~90–95% of your 1RM as your TM.\n\nPercentages in the program are calculated from your TM, not your true 1RM.\n\nWeekly progression rules:\n\nHeavy main lifts (SBD): increase TM 2–5 lb upper body, 5–10 lb lower body if sets feel fast and bar speed is smooth.\n\nVariations / paused / tempo lifts: increase 1–2% or 2–5 lb weekly, focusing on clean reps.\n\nVolume / technique days: keep same weight for 2–3 weeks; increase only when all reps feel fast.\n\nRPE / Bar speed check:\n\nIf all reps are easy → increase weight next week\n\nIf reps are challenging but complete → keep TM same\n\nIf reps fail or slow down → reduce TM slightly\n\nAccessory lifts:\n\nUse small, steady increases to build muscle without interfering with main lifts.\n\nMost accessories hit 2× per week; rest 60–120 sec between sets.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":6,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-08-10T20:13:07.273Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["HEAVY S/B DAY","BENCH VOLUME DAY","TECHNIQUE DAY","HEAVY DEADLIFT/BENCH SUPPORT"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"High Bar Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":78,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":76,"x":3}]},{"n":"Squat (Paused)","sets":[{"r":4,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lying Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Abs Crunch (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (